scripts.text:
{0}
The {1}
in Ayothaya has special weapons.
You can find great weapons there.
Is there anything else I can do for you?

scripts.translation:
{0}
哎喲泰雅的{1}有獨特的武器，您一定能在那裡找到好武器。
還有什麼需要幫忙的嗎？

scripts.text:
{0}
To calm your heart, go to the {1} and say a prayer.
Is there anything else I can do for you?

scripts.translation:
{0}
想讓心情平靜下來的話，就去{1}祈禱吧。
還有什麼需要幫忙的嗎？

scripts.text:
{0}
If you want to return home
find {1}
and ask him to send you back.
Is there anything else I can do for you?

scripts.translation:
{0}
如果您想回家，就去找{1}，請他送您回去。
還有什麼需要幫忙的嗎？

scripts.text:
{0}
I'll remove all marks from your mini-map.
Do you need anything else??

scripts.translation:
{0}
我會清除您小地圖上的所有標記。
還需要什麼嗎？
